TI  - Joint Impacts of Bus Rapid Transit and Urban Form on Vehicle Ownership: New Evidence from a Quasi-Longitudinal Analysis in Bogotá, Colombia
AU  - Combs Tabitha S
AU  - Rodríguez Daniel A
JO  - Transportation Research Part A: Policy and Practice
VL  - A 69
IS  - 
