AU  - Sonnenschein, Tabea
AU  - Scheider, Simon
AU  - Zheng, Siqi
JO  - ENVIRONMENT AND PLANNING B-URBAN ANALYTICS AND CITY SCIENCE
VL  - 49
IS  - 4
SP  - 1266
EP  - 1282
