TI  - How Does Toll Road Impact Accessibilities, Trades, and Investments in Short Term? A Case Study of Cipali Toll Road in West Java, Indonesia
AU  - Ardiyono Kadam, Sulistiyo
AU  - Andi Parenrengi, Nurul
AU  - Faturachman, Faturachman
JO  - JOURNAL OF INFRASTRUCTURE POLICY AND DEVELOPMENT
VL  - 2
